# package-lock.json IS committed, so CI installs with `npm ci` (reproducible)
# and `cache: npm` in .github/workflows/build.yml can be enabled.
# To go back to ignoring it: uncomment the next line, delete the lockfile, and
# leave `cache: npm` in that workflow COMMENTED OUT -- it hard-fails without a
# lockfile. See README -> "A note on the lockfile".
#/package-lock.json
